  "description": "In Garin’s hometown, the small island of Young-do, there exists a legend known to all who live there. Every person who leaves Young-Do is cursed by the mountain god and will face all kinds of misfortune.\n\n*“If… If… you’ve really cursed me… If you lift it… I’ll do anything!”\n\n“I’ll grant your wish, but in return…Give yourself to me and become my bride.”*\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
